{
  "id": "gears",
  "title": "Gears",
  "description": "Gears effort force vs. load force.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Gears\n\nA gear is a mechanical device that transmits rotary motion by changing the magnitude and line of action of the effort force.\n\nThe effort force can be expressed as:\n\n**F = W (r₁ r₂ ... rₙ) / (R₁ R₂ ... Rₙ)**\n\nWhere:\n- **F** = effort force (N, lbf)\n- **W** = load force or weight (N, lbf)\n- **r** = gear wheel inside diameter (m, in)\n- **R** = gear wheel outside diameter (m, in)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Value",
        "Unit"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "W",
          "label": "Load Force (W)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1000,
          "unit": "N"
        },
        {
          "id": "r1",
          "label": "Wheel 1 Inside Diameter (r₁)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.05,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "R1",
          "label": "Wheel 1 Outside Diameter (R₁)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.12,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "r2",
          "label": "Wheel 2 Inside Diameter (r₂)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.06,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "R2",
          "label": "Wheel 2 Outside Diameter (R₂)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.13,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "r3",
          "label": "Wheel 3 Inside Diameter (r₃)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.07,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "R3",
          "label": "Wheel 3 Outside Diameter (R₃)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.14,
          "unit": "m"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "F",
          "label": "Effort Force (F)",
          "formula": "inputs.W * (inputs.r1 * inputs.r2 * inputs.r3) / (inputs.R1 * inputs.R2 * inputs.R3)",
          "unit": "N",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "F_kN",
          "label": "Effort Force (F)",
          "formula": "(inputs.W * (inputs.r1 * inputs.r2 * inputs.r3) / (inputs.R1 * inputs.R2 * inputs.R3)) / 1000",
          "unit": "kN",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Wheel",
        "Inside Diameter (r)",
        "Outside Diameter (R)",
        "Ratio (r/R)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Wheel 1",
          0.05,
          0.12,
          "=A2/B2"
        ],
        [
          "Wheel 2",
          0.06,
          0.13,
          "=A3/B3"
        ],
        [
          "Wheel 3",
          0.07,
          0.14,
          "=A4/B4"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}